in%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%20don%E2%80%99t%20think%20there%20is%20a%20person%20alive%20who%20knows%20anything%20more%20solid%20than%20rumors%20and%20legends.%20There%20are%20very%20few%20people%20who%20even%20knows%20it%20exists!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Tallin%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22How%20did%20you%20come%20to%20know%20of%20it%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Camerin%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Some%20of%20the%20most%20ancient%20elvish%20legends%20make%20some%20vague%20mention%20of%20this%20artifact.%20But%20beyond%20that...%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Tallin%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Interesting.%20I%20wonder%20who%20%E2%80%94%20or%20what%20%E2%80%94%20could%20have%20created%20such%20a%20powerful%20artifact.%20There%20must%20be%20one%20heck%20of%20a%20story%20behind%20this%20thing.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22remove_item%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%22%24x1%22%2C%22y%22%3A%22%24y1%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22justice_rod%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22Rod%20of%20Justice%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22attacks%2Fstaff-magic.png%22%2C%22duration%22%3A%22forever%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22A%20magical%20staff%20of%20tremendous%20power%20and%20unknown%20origin.%20Although%20the%20full%20extent%20of%20its%20power%20has%20not%20been%20fathomed%2C%20there%20are%20a%20few%20features%20about%20it%20that%20will%20be%20obvious%20to%20any%20master%20of%20lore.%20The%20wielder%20of%20this%20staff%20gains%20a%20dramatic%20increase%20in%20strength%2C%20speed%20and%20intelligence%2C%20and%20is%20granted%20the%20ability%20to%20fire%20devastating%20lightning%20bolts%20at%20his%20opponents.%20Only%20a%20person%20who%20is%20good%20at%20heart%20and%20who%20is%20willing%20to%20sacrifice%20his%20life%20on%20the%20path%20of%20justice%20can%20wield%20this%20staff.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22%24unit.id%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22effect%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22apply_to%22%3A%22new_attack%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22rod%20of%20justice%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22rod%20of%20justice%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22fire%22%2C%22range%22%3A%22ranged%22%2C%22damage%22%3A%2216%22%2C%22number%22%3A%224%22%2C%22icon%22%3A%22attacks%2Flightning.png%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22specials%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22chance_to_hit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22magical%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22magical%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22This%20attack%20always%20has%20a%2070%25%20chance%20to%20hit%20regardless%20of%20the%20defensive%20ability%20of%20the%20unit%20being%20attacked.%22%2C%22special_note%22%3A%22This%20unit%20has%20magical%20attacks%2C%20which%20always%20have%20a%20high%20chance%20of%20hitting%20an%20opponent.%22%2C%22value%22%3A%2270%22%2C%22cumulative%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22effect%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22apply_to%22%3A%22new_animation%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22attack_anim%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22missile_start_time%22%3A%22-250%22%2C%22attack_sound_start_time%22%3A%22-300%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_attack%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22rod%20of%20justice%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22missile_frame%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22halo%22%3A%22halo%2Flightning-bolt-1-%5B1~4%5D.png%3A100%22%2C%22halo_y%22%3A%22-125%22%2C%22offset%22%3A%221.0%22%2C%22auto_vflip%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22halo_mod%22%3A%22~SWAP(alpha%2Cgreen%2Cgreen)%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22if%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22hits%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C