            text: _("Halt! Who goes there? Friend or foe?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Depends. Are you loyal to Malifor?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dulcatas",
            text: _("Never! If you ha’ been sent by Malifor, then know that we will never yield! Come and meet your death!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hold! We aren’t friends of Malifor in the least. Rather, we have come to destroy him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dulcatas",
            text: _("Finally! You don’t know how long we have been waiting for this day."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("How did you get here and how long have you been here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dulcatas",
            text: _("We were originally prisoners of Malifor, but we tunneled out and escaped. Since then, we have eked out a precarious survival on what we have been able to steal or raid from Malifor."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("By now you have tunnels all through this place."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dulcatas",
            text: _("Aye. That seemingly blank wall to the south there is actually a hidden entrance to the treasury."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Awesome, let’s go!"),
          },
        ],
      },
