        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_57",
        on: "branch_if_57",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            not_equals: "Tallin",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I... I am one of Tallin’s men..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Abhai",
            text: _("Who is this ‘Tallin’?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("That would be me."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_55",
        on: "capture",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_capturer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A%2231%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2225%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "wail-long.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Abhai",
            type: "Wraith",
            side: 1,
            x: 31,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Abhai",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Abhai",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("AH! A ghost!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Abhai",
            text: _("Who are you that dares to venture down these tunnels?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_56",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_57",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Abhai",
            text: _("What is your purpose in coming here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("We seek the destruction of the lich Malifor."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Abhai",
            text: _("Malifor...! Finally someone here in force to deal with that menace!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("<i>Did this spirit get even paler?</i> Can you tell us where he is? And, if I may ask, who are — or rather, were — you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Abhai",
            text: _("I am Lord Abhai, the ruler... once... of a great kingdom far to the west. In time, as all men do, I grew old and passed to the Land of the Dead. I know not how long I dwelt there, before I was wrenched from my peace and drawn into this realm by a terrible power."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Let me guess. Malifor?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Abhai",
            text: _("Indeed. He was once a great sorcerer, but he coveted wealth and power. To gain his ends, he allied himself with the Lich-Lords, and from them he learned their craft. When the orcish menace first appeared on the continent and the Wesfolk fled to the east, Malifor left their service and followed. No word surfaced of his fate from then on, but it seems he became a lich himself. I am not surprised he took up residence in these mines, all these years later — he always had a love of gold, and a special hatred of me. He tried to break me into mindless slavery, but I resisted his power and fled. I have been hiding in these flooded tunnels ever since. Some monster that Malifor’s minions greatly fear lives in these waters; they do not molest me here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("I am afraid times have changed much. Our first king, Haldric I, fled the Green Isle with the Wesfolk, the orcs in pursuit. He came ashore on this land that we now call the Great Continent and destroyed the Lich-Lord Jevyan before founding the Kingdom of Wesnoth. That was centuries ago."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Abhai",
            text: _("So... much time has passed indeed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Would you join us to defeat this evil creature?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Abhai",
            text: _("Wouldn’t miss it. Maybe after he is destroyed my kind and I can live... er... be dead peacefully."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Abhai",
            text: _("Keep following these flooded tunnels. I think they might lead you directly to Malifor."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Great. Forward, men!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_59",
        on: "branch_if_59",
        once: true,
        children: [
